    {
      "text": "A photograph of a mobile money or phone top-up kiosk: a woman in the foreground reaches across a wooden counter to hand cash to a seated attendant visible through a wooden serving window; a small device resembling a mobile-money terminal, a basic mobile phone and a paper ledger sit on the counter between them. Illustrates the AXIS 3 Financial health section.",
